//
// vllm-sr/d3-edge verify gate: the d3 decision gate (gate.py), NPU vs the
// upstream d3 runtime on CPU in BF16 (reference.py) over the 67 questions of
// requests.json. A question passes with finite option logits, each answer in
// the other's top 2, and equal answers where the reference's top-2 margin is
// at least 0.05. d3 has no LM head, so the shared verify/ top-k token check
// does not apply; this is the model's correctness gate. NPU weights and
// reference: vllm-sr/d3-edge at its pinned revision (sha256 checked), in the
// default weight form.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, peano_ge22, hf_token, hfweights_vllm_sr_d3_edge
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_npu2_verify
// RUN: cd test_npu2_verify
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% make -f %S/Makefile verify | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: [d3 gate] PASS 67/67
